# --- Old domain -> new domain -------------------------------------------------
# callout-ai.com is kept registered forever (published video shortlinks and
# Google's existing index both point at it) but must 301 to cutrank.app rather
# than serve a duplicate copy of the site.
#
# EXCEPTION, must stay first: the Search Console verification file has to remain
# reachable on the OLD domain, otherwise that property loses verification and the
# Change of Address flow can't run. Serve it, don't redirect it.
https://callout-ai.com/google47e58fafcbf4ab45.html   /google47e58fafcbf4ab45.html   200
http://callout-ai.com/google47e58fafcbf4ab45.html    /google47e58fafcbf4ab45.html   200

# Everything else moves permanently. The ! forces the redirect to win over the
# static file that exists at the same path.
https://callout-ai.com/*       https://cutrank.app/:splat   301!
http://callout-ai.com/*        https://cutrank.app/:splat   301!
https://www.callout-ai.com/*   https://cutrank.app/:splat   301!
http://www.callout-ai.com/*    https://cutrank.app/:splat   301!

